1
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,220
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:27,580
-Hurry up.
-Easy! My leg!

3
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:34,096
Chief, while I was following Meng Tinghui,

4
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,860
I found this cripple following her too.

5
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,496
He was the gatekeeper
at our gambling house.

6
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,736
The last time Meng Tinghui went there,

7
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,776
he was the one who spotted her.

8
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,100
He told me

9
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,180
he has a way to bring Meng Tinghui down.

10
00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:46,700
Who exactly are you?

11
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,540
Chief.

12
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:51,136
I am Meng Tinghui's enemy.

13
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:53,580
I knew that girl ten years ago.

14
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:56,496
She is the one who ruined my leg.

15
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,096
Because of Meng Tinghui,

16
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,816
I became a cripple despised by everyone.

17
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:02,136
I had to change my name

18
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,896
and flee my homeland.

19
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,976
For ten years, I have not
slept a peaceful night.

20
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,140
I long to devour her flesh
and drink her blood, Chief.

21
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,896
My hatred for that wretch

22
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,096
is no less than yours.

23
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:14,296
I want to join the Tiger Roar Gang.

24
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,820
Become my protector,

25
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,980
and I will help you eliminate her.

26
00:03:20,640 --> 00:03:22,056
I investigated him.

27
00:03:22,080 --> 00:03:24,420
Ten years ago, he was indeed in Shazhou,

28
00:03:24,880 --> 00:03:26,540
trafficking children.

29
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,936
A man who even dared sell children

30
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,736
thinks he can bargain with me?

31
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:46,576
Spare me, Chief!

32
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:49,296
I truly lost my senses back then.

33
00:03:49,320 --> 00:03:50,616
I deserve to die.

34
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:51,980
But Chief,

35
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,896
Meng Tinghui's dearest sister

36
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:57,456
died by my hand.

37
00:03:57,480 --> 00:03:59,860
I know what she fears and hates.

38
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:01,376
With me,

39
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,700
you can bring her down. Please give me a chance.

40
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,940
All right.

41
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:10,380
I will let you try.

42
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:14,256
Remember, you are merely a cripple

43
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,376
driven mad by his thirst for revenge.

44
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:18,220
You have absolutely nothing

45
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:21,940
-to do with the Tiger Roar Gang.
-Thank you, Chief.

46
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:37,496
Wait.

47
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,456
Do not add salt until
the meat turns golden.

48
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,900
Miss Yan,

49
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:43,936
this is the authentic Beijian method.

50
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:44,896
You...

51
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,980
Would you know better
than someone from Shazhou?

52
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,820
Mengmeng, you be the judge.

53
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,896
Mengmeng.

54
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,700
Why are you so distracted?

55
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,980
Nothing.

56
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,856
I may have been overworked lately

57
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:00,256
and unable to settle my mind.

58
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,176
Then relax properly today.

59
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:04,576
Young Lord Shen has spared no expense

60
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:06,216
on this grand banquet
to celebrate your success.

61
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,180
He chose to hold the feast here.

62
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:10,220
I suspect the wine is not his true concern.

63
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,576
There are so many
restaurants on Changle Street,

64
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,136
yet he chose your Bofeng House.

65
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:16,660
His intentions are hardly insignificant.

66
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:19,496
That is because I have the finest view

67
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:21,176
and the best roasted meat.

68
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,376
As for Shen Zhishu,

69
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:23,496
apart from that face,

70
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:24,696
what else does he have to offer?

71
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,696
He spends all day flirting with women.

72
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,220
He is clearly unreliable.

73
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,896
Last time...

74
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:32,296
Last time, I even saw him at Huiyin House.

75
00:05:32,320 --> 00:05:33,816
You even remember which
butterfly he was chasing

76
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,736
that time so clearly.

77
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,140
You...

78
00:05:36,880 --> 00:05:38,336
I merely felt

79
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,816
sorry for the ladies of the capital.

80
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,736
Shopkeeper Yan,

81
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,656
you must answer for speaking
behind someone's back.

82
00:05:42,680 --> 00:05:43,696
You clearly just said

83
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,896
that my face was worth looking at.

84
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:46,496
Young Lord Shen is here.

85
00:05:46,520 --> 00:05:47,896
Greetings, Your Majesty.

86
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,216
Your Majesty!

87
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,576
No need for ceremony.
I brought some fine wine today

88
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:53,296
to celebrate with everyone.

89
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,540
Rise.

90
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,896
I do not know what is wrong with my legs.

91
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,616
Whenever I see His Majesty,
they stop obeying me

92
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:01,816
and want to kneel and
kowtow again and again.

93
00:06:01,840 --> 00:06:04,016
Shen Zhishu, why did you not tell me
His Majesty was coming?

94
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:06,016
Although I invited everyone today,

95
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,336
I did so at His Majesty's request

96
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,536
to celebrate Official Meng's success.

97
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:11,456
The Left Chancellor
has recently been sending

98
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,176
many noblewomen into the palace
to press His Majesty to choose an empress.

99
00:06:13,200 --> 00:06:15,176
-His Majesty came out to escape the commotion.
-Enough.

100
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:16,540
Let us eat.

101
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,416
The lamb is ready.

102
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,096
There are also dishes from my hometown.

103
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:21,016
Please try them.

104
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,336
Anything you cooked

105
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,660
His Majesty would not dare taste
anything you cooked.

106
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:28,020
Then perhaps we should taste it
for His Majesty first.

107
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:36,620
Fresh and delicious.

108
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,576
It is good.

109
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:41,020
My lord has excellent taste. I like it too.

110
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,216
What is this?

111
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,136
How dare you, Yin Qing!

112
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,296
You tried to poison His Majesty!

113
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,496
No...

114
00:06:57,520 --> 00:06:58,776
This is fish mint.

115
00:06:58,800 --> 00:06:59,856
It is edible.

116
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:02,176
Look, my lord is enjoying it.

117
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,296
Perhaps His Majesty's tastes

118
00:07:03,320 --> 00:07:05,580
and my lord's tastes differ...

119
00:07:06,040 --> 00:07:07,260
greatly.

120
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:10,456
Huang Bo, bring the wine.

121
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:12,056
Wait.

122
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:14,416
The weather has been turning colder,

123
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,056
so I brewed some fruit wine

124
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,536
for everyone to taste.

125
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,060
Wonderful!

126
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:39,540
My turn.

127
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:43,576
This fruit wine

128
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,416
nourishes the complexion

129
00:07:45,440 --> 00:07:47,980
and makes one glow.

130
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:51,180
However...

131
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,620
for Official Meng and Miss Yan,

132
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,496
its effects will be rather ordinary.

133
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,860
-Why?
-Why?

134
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,536
Because you two

135
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:01,580
are naturally beautiful.

136
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,580
Yin Qing,

137
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,256
you have been working nonstop.

138
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,336
Sit down and rest.

139
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,500
Certainly.

140
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,496
The lamb has gone a little cold.

141
00:08:25,520 --> 00:08:27,500
-It needs reheating.
-I will do it.

142
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:37,496
The fruit wine is cold too. Warm it up.

143
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:40,100
Of course. Here I go again.

144
00:08:42,800 --> 00:08:45,020
Yin Qing, I will help you.

145
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,736
How could your cooking compare with his?

146
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,060
Sit.

147
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,256
If Your Majesty has any
grievance against me,

148
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,860
please say it directly.

149
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,496
When have I ever had
a grievance against you?

150
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:14,456
Then why is Your Majesty making things
difficult for my colleague?

151
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,980
You call that making things difficult?

152
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,856
It seems Director Meng

153
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:22,020
cares far more about
her colleagues than about me.

154
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:30,420
Your Majesty.

155
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,816
Changle Street was crowded
with people and carriages.

156
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,416
I am sorry to have
kept Your Majesty waiting.

157
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,456
I also spent a little time dressing,

158
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,376
which delayed me.

159
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,176
Sit down and try
the specialties of Shazhou.

160
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,500
Come, sit over here.

161
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:43,296
I know you do not eat ginger.

162
00:09:43,320 --> 00:09:45,096
This has neither scallions nor garlic.

163
00:09:45,120 --> 00:09:46,296
I guarantee you will like it.

164
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:47,536
Thank you, Yin Qing.

165
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,500
You are always the
kindest and most attentive.

166
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:51,976
So there is someone in this world

167
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,856
who understands
Zhili's tastes better than you.

168
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:54,976
Still,

169
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,936
it is good for Zhili to spend
more time with Yin Qing.

170
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,936
After all, she is an unmarried young woman.

171
00:09:57,960 --> 00:10:00,060
It is better than being
too close to her teacher.

172
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,056
Sister Shen, Captain Di,

173
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,896
you are late. You must drink
three cups as punishment.

174
00:10:05,920 --> 00:10:07,096
Very well.

175
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,176
I will drink

176
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:09,456
Sister Zhili's share for her.

177
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,700
There is no need...

178
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,180
Captain Di, sit down.

179
00:10:13,760 --> 00:10:14,656
This

180
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,340
is fruit wine I brewed myself.

181
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:17,816
It is good for the complexion.

182
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:19,780
Do you know Sister Zhili
cannot hold her liquor?

183
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,816
Today is a celebration.
We should enjoy ourselves.

184
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:29,976
Tomorrow,

185
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,980
we will surely find a
clue to the Tiger Roar Gang.

186
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:35,860
Then let us wish

187
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,740
for everything to go smoothly tomorrow.

188
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:41,540
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

189
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,736
Official Meng stands high above everyone

190
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,776
and can naturally speak
grandly of conscience.

191
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,420
But for people like us,

192
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,700
kindness...

193
00:11:08,440 --> 00:11:10,580
only makes us die sooner.

194
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:17,300
You use having no choice as an excuse

195
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,416
to help tyrants commit
evil with a clear conscience?

196
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,100
As a fellow woman,

197
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,176
you watched those girls

198
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,336
be pushed into a living hell.

199
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:27,296
You heard them cry and beg for help,

200
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:29,416
yet you smiled as you handed
their tormentors the whip.

201
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,740
A-Yue was only eighteen.

202
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:34,176
She was tortured to death.

203
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,340
Have you never had nightmares at night?

204
00:11:40,280 --> 00:11:41,420
Nightmares?

205
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:50,540
Official Meng,

206
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,696
this is what

207
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,940
the conscience you speak of brought me.

208
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,180
I was only fourteen

209
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,816
when I was sold there.

210
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:01,580
They tortured me like livestock.

211
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:05,380
I was locked in the gambling house dungeon.

212
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,856
They chained me to an iron post

213
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,776
for an entire month,

214
00:12:08,800 --> 00:12:10,256
drugged me,

215
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:12,660
and then hung me naked

216
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,620
from the gambling house's second floor.

217
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,776
They let every gambler wager

218
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:18,780
on how many days it would take me to beg.

219
00:12:20,160 --> 00:12:22,100
Do you think I had a choice?

220
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:26,180
Either submit

221
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,580
or die.

222
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,180
I did not want to die.

223
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,780
I wanted to live.

224
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:37,296
Even if I had to live like a ghost,

225
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:38,860
I still wanted to live.

226
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,900
Was I wrong?

227
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,216
Official Meng,

228
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:46,180
Not everyone is entitled

229
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:49,300
to live with clean hands like you.

230
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:12,500
Tell me about the dealings

231
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:14,900
between Xingrong Gambling House
and the Tiger Roar Gang.

232
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,456
I stake my life on it:

233
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:18,620
I will avenge this blood debt for you.

234
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,980
Fumeng,

235
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:22,620
you still hate them, do you not?

236
00:13:22,960 --> 00:13:24,576
You hate the people who made you this way.

237
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:27,296
But if you continue
helping them commit evil,

238
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:29,896
you are stabbing the girl you once were.

239
00:13:29,920 --> 00:13:31,696
If Hao Wenming truly
regarded you as one of his own,

240
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:33,136
why are you

241
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:34,496
still confined to the gambling house?

242
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:35,816
Fumeng,

243
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,980
you know their methods better than anyone.

244
00:13:38,640 --> 00:13:39,780
Speak.

245
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,620
Have you ever considered

246
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,180
what they fear?

247
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,096
What they fear most

248
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:46,256
is people like you

249
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,940
standing up to testify against them.

250
00:13:50,880 --> 00:13:52,660
But what you want to know,

251
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,696
I truly know nothing about.

252
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,656
Hao Wenming

253
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:58,736
never allowed those under him

254
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:00,576
to ask about the Tiger Roar Gang.

255
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:03,096
We only handled odd
jobs at the gambling house

256
00:14:03,120 --> 00:14:04,776
and sent the girls into the private rooms.

257
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:07,136
So I have never met
anyone from the Tiger Roar Gang.

258
00:14:07,160 --> 00:14:09,220
You became Hao Wenming's most trusted aide,

259
00:14:09,760 --> 00:14:10,656
and you still pretend to know nothing?

260
00:14:10,680 --> 00:14:12,216
Hao Wenming

261
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,660
was extremely cautious.

262
00:14:14,120 --> 00:14:15,816
Besides, with matters at this point,

263
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,540
what reason would I have to hide anything?

264
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:20,736
I will die either way.

265
00:14:20,760 --> 00:14:22,136
Let me serve those girls

266
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,700
as an ox or horse in the afterlife.

267
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:25,940
I will kneel before them

268
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:28,260
and beg forgiveness.

269
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,140
My lord.

270
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:35,500
Our only breakthrough now is Hao Wenming.

271
00:14:45,360 --> 00:14:47,420
Brother Hao, wake up.

272
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:50,216
Fumeng has confessed everything

273
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,100
about Xingrong Gambling House
and the Tiger Roar Gang.

274
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,300
If you can tell us something new,

275
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:55,980
you may be allowed to live.

276
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,380
She does not know a damn thing.

277
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,620
You two little brats

278
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,380
are trying to trick me.

279
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:16,660
Under severe punishment, cowards emerge.

280
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,060
Under great rewards, brave men emerge.

281
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,940
Would you care to gamble with your life?

282
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:24,496
Let us see whether, if you keep silent,

283
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,936
the Tiger Roar Gang comes to rescue you

284
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:27,220
or comes to kill you.

285
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,496
Tell us everything you
know about Ling Yunfei

286
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:33,096
and every court official colluding
with the Tiger Roar Gang.

287
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,656
Do not omit a single word.

288
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,176
Hao Wenming,

289
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,980
this is your only chance to live.

290
00:15:40,080 --> 00:15:41,096
My lord,

291
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:42,820
why waste words on him?

292
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,460
Until he tastes the branding iron,

293
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:48,100
he will keep pretending to be tough.

294
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,736
I...

295
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:05,336
I will confess...

296
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:06,576
I will.

297
00:16:06,600 --> 00:16:07,536
I will tell you everything.

298
00:16:07,560 --> 00:16:09,336
I will write down

299
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:10,660
everything I know.

300
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:20,540
Guards!

301
00:16:30,280 --> 00:16:31,616
Call a physician.

302
00:16:31,640 --> 00:16:32,780
Yes.

303
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:37,900
You would rather die than confess.

304
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:39,540
I fear death,

305
00:16:40,920 --> 00:16:43,300
but I fear Ling Yunfei even more.

306
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:46,740
A traitor's

307
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,500
entire family is buried with him.

308
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,740
That is the Tiger Roar Gang's rule.

309
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:56,380
The day I boarded this ship,

310
00:16:58,240 --> 00:17:00,420
I wrote my will

311
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:03,136
for my wife and children.

312
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:05,420
You only need to stand up and testify,

313
00:17:06,320 --> 00:17:08,540
and I can destroy the Tiger Roar Gang.

314
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,060
Official Meng.

315
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,580
You...

316
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:16,420
are good people.

317
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,016
What happened to me today

318
00:17:18,040 --> 00:17:20,856
is entirely what I deserve.

319
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,540
You cannot defeat him.

320
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:25,620
Besides...

321
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,940
The one you are fighting

322
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:30,500
has never

323
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,776
been him alone.

324
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:34,060
Who else is there?

325
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,180
Tell me.

326
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:41,220
Official Meng,

327
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:44,020
I beg you...

328
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,580
For my family's sake,

329
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:49,820
just say

330
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:52,580
that I confessed nothing.

331
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:56,576
Where is the physician?

332
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:57,740
Physician!

333
00:17:58,720 --> 00:17:59,860
Hao Wenming!

334
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:40,216
You have worked hard
on the case these past few days

335
00:18:40,240 --> 00:18:41,736
and have hardly eaten a proper meal.

336
00:18:41,760 --> 00:18:43,616
Set official business aside tonight

337
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,576
and try Bofeng House's

338
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:46,056
new signature dishes.

339
00:18:46,080 --> 00:18:47,340
All right.

340
00:18:49,360 --> 00:18:50,976
There are many guests tonight.

341
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:52,336
I will attend to the front hall.

342
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:54,060
You must all eat properly.

343
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,056
All right.

344
00:18:56,080 --> 00:18:57,660
Especially you.

345
00:19:06,200 --> 00:19:07,416
I have no appetite.

346
00:19:07,440 --> 00:19:09,616
Our bluff failed.

347
00:19:09,640 --> 00:19:11,056
Fumeng said

348
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,616
the only person in contact
with the Tiger Roar Gang

349
00:19:12,640 --> 00:19:14,220
was Hao Wenming.

350
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,856
Now Hao Wenming is dead,

351
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,056
and every lead is gone.

352
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:18,856
Ling Yunfei's whereabouts are unknown.

353
00:19:18,880 --> 00:19:20,500
And the force behind him...

354
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,860
who exactly are they?

355
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:26,420
I previously suspected

356
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:28,696
that the cross Wan Kai left behind

357
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,500
may instead concern someone's identity.

358
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:33,256
Before dying, Hao Wenming
also deliberately said

359
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:35,096
that I was not fighting Ling Yunfei alone.

360
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:37,700
Lü Er also mentioned the person behind him
before he died.

361
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:39,860
Could all three clues

362
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:42,460
point to the same person?

363
00:19:44,800 --> 00:19:45,940
It is possible.

364
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:47,976
Could this cross

365
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:50,060
be part of a written character?

366
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:51,576
"Xiang."

367
00:19:51,600 --> 00:19:52,736
Could it

368
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:54,300
refer to a Chancellor?

369
00:19:54,640 --> 00:19:56,496
Someone with overwhelming power...

370
00:19:56,520 --> 00:19:57,900
That could very well
be the Left Chancellor.

371
00:19:58,680 --> 00:20:00,656
Add a box beneath the
cross and it forms "Gu."

372
00:20:00,680 --> 00:20:01,896
It could also point
to the Right Chancellor.

373
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,260
Absolutely impossible.

374
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,096
I know my teacher's character well.

375
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,576
He is not the kind of treacherous schemer

376
00:20:06,600 --> 00:20:07,736
who would collude with Ling Yunfei.

377
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,656
I will stake my reputation on him.

378
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,616
I was only making a guess.

379
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,536
Why take it so seriously?

380
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:14,176
That was hardly a guess.

381
00:20:14,200 --> 00:20:15,256
It was baseless nonsense.

382
00:20:15,280 --> 00:20:17,060
Zhili also has a point.

383
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:20,180
Without conclusive evidence,

384
00:20:20,720 --> 00:20:23,060
every suspicion is merely speculation.

385
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:26,776
To uncover the truth,

386
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:28,096
we must find Ling Yunfei.

387
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,576
Other shops on Changle Street

388
00:20:29,600 --> 00:20:31,616
may also be connected
to the Tiger Roar Gang.

389
00:20:31,640 --> 00:20:33,136
We cannot let go

390
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:34,056
of even the slightest possibility.

391
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:35,336
-Yes.
-Yes.

392
00:20:35,360 --> 00:20:36,500
Then we...

393
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:37,976
should eat properly.

394
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:39,620
Especially you.

395
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:53,856
-Shopkeeper Yan.
-Shopkeeper Yan.

396
00:20:53,880 --> 00:20:55,656
Is Official Meng here today?

397
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,940
Could we meet Official Meng?

398
00:20:58,560 --> 00:20:59,976
Meet Mengmeng?

399
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:02,176
Yes. Official Meng destroyed

400
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:04,016
the wicked Xingrong
Gambling House in one stroke

401
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:05,696
and saved so many women.

402
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:07,216
-She is truly a heroine among women.
-Shopkeeper Yan.

403
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,496
You are here too.

404
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:10,100
Come, let me through.

405
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:12,416
Though Shopkeeper Yan and Official Meng
are not sisters by blood,

406
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:14,256
they are closer than true sisters.

407
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:15,296
To have such a friend

408
00:21:15,320 --> 00:21:16,856
-is truly enviable.
-Shopkeeper Yan.

409
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,376
We came because of her reputation.

410
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:19,376
Could you make an exception

411
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,656
and let us meet Official Meng?

412
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:21,856
Yes.

413
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:23,136
Please let us meet her.

414
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:24,816
Everyone, please be patient.

415
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:27,216
Official Meng is busy today
and cannot be disturbed.

416
00:21:27,240 --> 00:21:28,376
However,

417
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:30,736
I will personally cook for all of you today.

418
00:21:30,760 --> 00:21:31,816
-Great!
-Great!

419
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:32,980
Please come inside.

420
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:35,540
We finally get to taste Shopkeeper Yan's cooking.

421
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:41,976
Mengmeng.

422
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:43,140
What is wrong?

423
00:22:43,920 --> 00:22:45,060
Mengmeng.

424
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:47,500
Mengmeng, sit down first.

425
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:49,060
Slowly.

426
00:22:55,840 --> 00:22:57,856
Mengmeng, I made sugarcane
water especially for you.

427
00:22:57,880 --> 00:23:00,376
It replenishes the blood, relieves dryness,
and nourishes digestion.

428
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,540
Drink some more.

429
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:10,456
Mengmeng,

430
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:11,816
Bofeng House was bustling today.

431
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:12,776
So many people came,

432
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:14,136
all hoping to see you.

433
00:23:14,160 --> 00:23:16,820
They all called you a hero of Great Ning.

434
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:22,820
The more they praise me,

435
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:28,860
the worse I feel.

436
00:23:30,600 --> 00:23:32,660
Every lead to the
Tiger Roar Gang is now gone.

437
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:35,220
If we cannot capture Ling Yunfei,

438
00:23:36,160 --> 00:23:37,696
all that praise

439
00:23:37,720 --> 00:23:39,460
will eventually turn into condemnation.

440
00:23:40,960 --> 00:23:43,660
You cannot put so much
pressure on yourself.

441
00:23:51,800 --> 00:23:52,940
Fuzhi,

442
00:23:53,840 --> 00:23:55,096
I am no longer the orphan girl from Shazhou

443
00:23:55,120 --> 00:23:56,860
who had nothing.

444
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:00,260
Now I wear an official robe

445
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,740
and carry the people's hopes.

446
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:04,896
I understand even more clearly where

447
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,260
the Bureau's official lantern should shine.

448
00:24:07,760 --> 00:24:09,500
The Tiger Roar Gang must be eliminated

449
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:12,216
so desperate people hidden in dark corners

450
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:13,620
can have a little more hope.

451
00:24:14,320 --> 00:24:16,260
Of course I believe in you.

452
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:19,056
But you must promise me:

453
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,576
when you hold an umbrella over others,

454
00:24:20,600 --> 00:24:22,420
protect yourself first.

455
00:24:30,320 --> 00:24:31,896
-I must leave now.
-Where are you going?

456
00:24:31,920 --> 00:24:34,696
Back to the palace to report
our leads to His Majesty,

457
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:36,740
before he suspects me
of withholding information again.

458
00:24:45,640 --> 00:24:46,860
Miss Meng.

459
00:24:50,760 --> 00:24:51,856
Miss Meng!

460
00:24:51,880 --> 00:24:54,336
I have come today with betrothal gifts

461
00:24:54,360 --> 00:24:56,020
to take you as my wife.

462
00:24:56,840 --> 00:24:57,980
Miss Meng.

463
00:24:58,800 --> 00:25:00,096
So you do not even know

464
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,260
which one is Miss Meng?

465
00:25:05,520 --> 00:25:07,540
Then this lady must be Miss Meng.

466
00:25:08,560 --> 00:25:10,856
I never imagined you were
even more beautiful than the rumors.

467
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:12,900
You are so lovely.
I am determined to marry you.

468
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:15,580
Stop.

469
00:25:25,560 --> 00:25:26,736
You think you are worthy?

470
00:25:26,760 --> 00:25:28,300
Who are you?

471
00:25:29,120 --> 00:25:31,980
I never conceal my name or identity.

472
00:25:32,160 --> 00:25:34,416
Xu Ting, the current Left Chancellor,
is my father.

473
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:36,136
I am his only son,

474
00:25:36,160 --> 00:25:37,940
Xu Runze.

475
00:25:40,520 --> 00:25:41,660
Miss Meng,

476
00:25:41,920 --> 00:25:42,936
trust me.

477
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:44,536
If the two of us marry,

478
00:25:44,560 --> 00:25:45,736
we will be a match made in heaven:

479
00:25:45,760 --> 00:25:47,296
a talented man and a
beautiful woman. No, wait...

480
00:25:47,320 --> 00:25:48,576
a talented woman and a handsome man.

481
00:25:48,600 --> 00:25:49,820
Keep your distance.

482
00:25:50,240 --> 00:25:51,376
Young Master Xu,

483
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:53,900
does your father know you are out here
embarrassing yourself?

484
00:25:54,520 --> 00:25:55,856
My father said

485
00:25:55,880 --> 00:25:57,260
that a true man

486
00:25:57,600 --> 00:26:00,180
must charge forward once
he sees what he wants.

487
00:26:01,080 --> 00:26:03,260
Besides, I already wrote
the marriage contract.

488
00:26:05,120 --> 00:26:06,896
Today, the handsome

489
00:26:06,920 --> 00:26:09,256
and charming Xu Runze

490
00:26:09,280 --> 00:26:10,656
wishes to marry the breathtaking

491
00:26:10,680 --> 00:26:13,340
and talented Meng Tinghui.

492
00:26:13,600 --> 00:26:14,900
In this life,

493
00:26:15,320 --> 00:26:16,460
she shall be his only one.

494
00:26:18,560 --> 00:26:19,816
Thank you all for your support.

495
00:26:19,840 --> 00:26:21,900
Every expense at Bofeng House today

496
00:26:22,440 --> 00:26:24,176
is on me.

497
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,536
Eat and drink to your hearts' content.

498
00:26:25,560 --> 00:26:26,856
Wonderful!

499
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:28,900
-Eat up. Everyone, sit.
-Yan Fuzhi!

500
00:26:29,320 --> 00:26:30,460
Young Master Xu,

501
00:26:30,800 --> 00:26:32,256
you and I have never met.

502
00:26:32,280 --> 00:26:33,336
How can there be any talk of marriage?

503
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:35,216
Please leave Bofeng House at once.

504
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:36,136
It seems

505
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:37,936
Young Master Xu has gone foolish
from studying too much.

506
00:26:37,960 --> 00:26:39,016
No...

507
00:26:39,040 --> 00:26:40,336
My father said

508
00:26:40,360 --> 00:26:41,856
I am foolish because I studied too little.

509
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:44,616
That is why I need a talented wife
to improve the family bloodline.

510
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:46,056
Miss Meng, just consider it...

511
00:26:46,080 --> 00:26:47,376
for the sake of the
Xu family's future descendants.

512
00:26:47,400 --> 00:26:49,496
-Marry me.
-Young Master Xu.

513
00:26:49,520 --> 00:26:50,936
Please stop making jokes at my expense.

514
00:26:50,960 --> 00:26:53,056
Miss Meng, I sincerely wish to marry you.

515
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:55,896
My family has power, influence, and wealth.

516
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,936
You need not worry that
you are unworthy of me.

517
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,856
When I, Xu Runze, take a wife,

518
00:26:58,880 --> 00:27:00,416
I do not care about her family background.

519
00:27:00,440 --> 00:27:02,780
She only needs to be clever
and well-read like you.

520
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:04,656
Servants!

521
00:27:04,680 --> 00:27:06,860
Carry every betrothal
gift into Bofeng House.

522
00:27:07,400 --> 00:27:08,576
Put them down.

523
00:27:08,600 --> 00:27:09,496
Let us see who dares.

524
00:27:09,520 --> 00:27:10,980
-Who dares enter?
-Wait.

525
00:27:19,840 --> 00:27:21,016
Young Master Xu,

526
00:27:21,040 --> 00:27:22,900
you are humiliating Miss Meng.

527
00:27:23,640 --> 00:27:24,856
Miss Situ,

528
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,176
what gives you the right to say that?

529
00:27:26,200 --> 00:27:27,616
Is Miss Meng the sort of woman

530
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:29,536
who would be swayed
by lavish betrothal gifts?

531
00:27:29,560 --> 00:27:31,340
By making such a spectacle,

532
00:27:31,960 --> 00:27:34,100
what position have you placed her in?

533
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:38,056
Miss Meng, let me explain.

534
00:27:38,080 --> 00:27:39,220
Young Master Xu,

535
00:27:39,760 --> 00:27:40,936
if you keep talking,

536
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:42,136
you will only make matters worse.

537
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:44,380
If you sincerely wish to marry Miss Meng,

538
00:27:44,680 --> 00:27:46,376
let us go to Huiyin House.

539
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,296
I have a plan.

540
00:27:47,320 --> 00:27:49,300
Miss Situ, let us leave at once.

541
00:27:59,320 --> 00:28:00,416
Young Master Xu,

542
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,740
what about your betrothal gifts?

543
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:04,940
They say the Left Chancellor has a son
with a most unusual mind.

544
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:07,740
Today, I finally witnessed it.

545
00:28:11,320 --> 00:28:13,096
-You...
-Chief Steward You.

546
00:28:13,120 --> 00:28:15,216
His Majesty is handling state affairs
and cannot be disturbed.

547
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:16,136
Huang Bo,

548
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,896
you brat, how can you be so unreasonable?

549
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:18,816
It is precisely because I know

550
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:20,536
His Majesty is busy with state affairs

551
00:28:20,560 --> 00:28:21,776
that I came especially to ease his worries.

552
00:28:21,800 --> 00:28:23,180
Stop blocking me.

553
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:26,336
Chief Steward You,

554
00:28:26,360 --> 00:28:28,256
His Majesty ordered
that no one disturb him.

555
00:28:28,280 --> 00:28:29,496
Please do not make things difficult for me.

556
00:28:29,520 --> 00:28:30,416
What?

557
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:31,856
Am I merely "no one"?

558
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,416
Others come to trouble His Majesty.

559
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:35,056
I came to make him happy.

560
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:36,220
Let me in.

561
00:28:36,840 --> 00:28:38,660
What are you doing...?

562
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:42,380
Your Majesty...

563
00:28:44,080 --> 00:28:44,976
Your Majesty,

564
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:46,816
this old servant heard you have been

565
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:48,460
overwhelmed with state affairs lately.

566
00:28:48,720 --> 00:28:51,216
I spent ten days and nights

567
00:28:51,240 --> 00:28:52,736
preparing a wonderful performance for you.

568
00:28:52,760 --> 00:28:54,380
-Please, Your Majesty...
-Let us go.

569
00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:57,856
Wonderful. Coming...

570
00:28:57,880 --> 00:29:00,020
Your Majesty, the dance begins.

571
00:29:28,760 --> 00:29:29,816
This is the surprise

572
00:29:29,840 --> 00:29:31,376
you spent ten days and nights preparing?

573
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,940
Your Majesty,

574
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,500
are you surprised?

575
00:29:34,800 --> 00:29:36,780
Are you delighted? Was it unexpected?

576
00:29:37,200 --> 00:29:38,096
These noble ladies

577
00:29:38,120 --> 00:29:41,456
are the finest dancers in the capital,

578
00:29:41,480 --> 00:29:44,300
especially Lady Wen.

579
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:57,376
You truly understand me.

580
00:29:57,400 --> 00:29:58,820
Thank you for the praise.

581
00:29:59,560 --> 00:30:00,816
Your Majesty,

582
00:30:00,840 --> 00:30:01,736
you must not leave.

583
00:30:01,760 --> 00:30:03,936
These ladies are all daughters
of important ministers.

584
00:30:03,960 --> 00:30:06,016
If you walk away like this,

585
00:30:06,040 --> 00:30:08,576
will you not chill the hearts
of your loyal officials?

586
00:30:08,600 --> 00:30:10,536
All my painstaking effort

587
00:30:10,560 --> 00:30:12,740
was for the sake of the realm.

588
00:30:13,240 --> 00:30:14,456
Please take pity

589
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:16,176
on these old bones

590
00:30:16,200 --> 00:30:18,860
and at least watch a
little longer, Your Majesty.

591
00:30:31,520 --> 00:30:34,540
This subject, Wen Ruomei,
respectfully greets Your Majesty.

592
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:40,376
-Greetings, Your Majesty.
-Greetings, Your Majesty.

593
00:30:40,400 --> 00:30:42,140
Your Majesty is in fine spirits.

594
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:50,256
Your Majesty.

595
00:30:50,280 --> 00:30:51,420
Your Maj...

596
00:30:55,440 --> 00:30:57,020
Official Meng is in fine spirits too.

597
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:59,056
You hid here to enjoy my performance.

598
00:30:59,080 --> 00:31:00,380
I have been wronged.

599
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:02,816
Had I spoken rashly,

600
00:31:02,840 --> 00:31:04,496
would I not have ruined
Your Majesty's pleasure

601
00:31:04,520 --> 00:31:06,256
in watching all these beauties compete?

602
00:31:06,280 --> 00:31:07,860
I shall take my leave.

603
00:31:09,960 --> 00:31:11,256
Too late.

604
00:31:11,280 --> 00:31:13,700
No one watches a performance
without paying the performers.

605
00:31:16,120 --> 00:31:17,376
Why not take the stage as well

606
00:31:17,400 --> 00:31:19,016
and compete

607
00:31:19,040 --> 00:31:20,656
with these noble ladies?

608
00:31:20,680 --> 00:31:22,536
Your Majesty intends to use me again.

609
00:31:22,560 --> 00:31:24,096
If I perform here,

610
00:31:24,120 --> 00:31:25,856
tomorrow at court

611
00:31:25,880 --> 00:31:27,096
there will surely be several more memorials

612
00:31:27,120 --> 00:31:28,256
impeaching me for currying favor.

613
00:31:28,280 --> 00:31:29,580
Would that not be perfect?

614
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:32,740
It would further prove
you are my favored official.

615
00:31:34,600 --> 00:31:36,900
Since Your Majesty wants me
to be this favored official,

616
00:31:37,520 --> 00:31:39,460
why not grant me a
substantive fifth-rank post,

617
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:41,016
so my reputation as a flattering favorite

618
00:31:41,040 --> 00:31:42,456
will finally match reality?

619
00:31:42,480 --> 00:31:44,940
You certainly know how to bargain.

620
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:46,936
One rank higher

621
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:48,500
means standing above others.

622
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:52,820
Since I will bear the infamy either way,

623
00:31:53,440 --> 00:31:55,256
I may as well gain
something tangible from it.

624
00:31:55,280 --> 00:31:56,896
Your Majesty, the dance is over.

625
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,736
The noble ladies are still waiting.

626
00:31:58,760 --> 00:32:00,140
I am in excellent spirits today.

627
00:32:00,840 --> 00:32:02,016
How about this?

628
00:32:02,040 --> 00:32:03,500
Compete once more.

629
00:32:03,760 --> 00:32:05,136
Whoever wins

630
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:07,220
will remain and dine with me.

631
00:32:12,480 --> 00:32:13,620
I will go first.

632
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:21,976
I once learned

633
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:23,780
a small street trick.

634
00:32:24,360 --> 00:32:27,060
It is called
"Spring Returns to Withered Wood."

635
00:32:27,440 --> 00:32:28,700
Your Majesty, please watch.

636
00:32:29,640 --> 00:32:31,456
This flower bud is waiting to bloom,

637
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:32,940
like uncarved jade,

638
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:35,136
holding limitless vitality within.

639
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:37,180
It lacks only a breath of spring.

640
00:32:38,120 --> 00:32:40,140
Your Majesty is the true Son of Heaven,

641
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:42,860
bearing the imperial
aura of the Purple Star.

642
00:32:43,120 --> 00:32:45,336
Please breathe

643
00:32:45,360 --> 00:32:47,140
a gentle breath of warmth upon this flower.

644
00:32:47,400 --> 00:32:48,416
Let it serve as the spark

645
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:50,300
that awakens its boundless spirit.

646
00:33:10,520 --> 00:33:12,140
-It truly bloomed!
-It bloomed!

647
00:33:12,520 --> 00:33:13,700
Your Majesty, please look.

648
00:33:14,600 --> 00:33:15,976
Though plants are humble,

649
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:17,620
even they know to
admire and follow strength.

650
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:20,580
Bathed in heavenly grace,
they burst into life.

651
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:22,220
This flower

652
00:33:22,560 --> 00:33:24,136
bloomed for Your Majesty.

653
00:33:24,160 --> 00:33:25,300
Excellent.

654
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:29,660
"Spring Returns to Withered Wood,"
and the weak follow the strong.

655
00:33:30,280 --> 00:33:31,780
Such amusement

656
00:33:32,200 --> 00:33:33,496
far surpasses song and dance.

657
00:33:33,520 --> 00:33:34,816
Your Majesty,

658
00:33:34,840 --> 00:33:36,936
Meng Tinghui is clearly using
a cheap street illusion.

659
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:38,176
It is unfit for refined company.

660
00:33:38,200 --> 00:33:40,180
Your Majesty holds the
people in your heart.

661
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:42,456
The amusements of the streets

662
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:44,180
also reflect the lives of the people.

663
00:33:44,520 --> 00:33:45,696
Whether all things under heaven

664
00:33:45,720 --> 00:33:47,776
can bask in imperial grace and flourish

665
00:33:47,800 --> 00:33:50,580
is what truly concerns Your Majesty.

666
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:53,980
Meng Tinghui, receive the decree.

667
00:33:55,160 --> 00:33:56,816
From this day forward,

668
00:33:56,840 --> 00:33:57,976
you are promoted to the full fifth rank

669
00:33:58,000 --> 00:34:00,056
and shall continue overseeing all affairs
of the Bureau of Intelligence.

670
00:34:00,080 --> 00:34:02,340
I thank Your Majesty for this great favor.

671
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:08,896
Official Meng, follow me
back to the Imperial Study

672
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:10,216
and explain properly

673
00:34:10,240 --> 00:34:11,136
what other amusements and wisdom

674
00:34:11,160 --> 00:34:13,700
can be found among the common people.

675
00:34:14,960 --> 00:34:16,100
Yes.

676
00:34:17,440 --> 00:34:18,536
Your Majesty.

677
00:34:18,560 --> 00:34:19,700
Your Majesty!

678
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,820
Your Majesty...

679
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:27,296
His Majesty and Official Meng

680
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:28,216
have important matters to discuss

681
00:34:28,240 --> 00:34:29,536
and cannot be disturbed.

682
00:34:29,560 --> 00:34:30,456
Please return home.

683
00:34:30,480 --> 00:34:31,736
-Sister Wen.
-Sister Wen.

684
00:34:31,760 --> 00:34:33,816
That seductress has bewitched His Majesty.

685
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,936
I will have my father report her
to the Left Chancellor.

686
00:34:35,960 --> 00:34:37,580
How did you do it?

687
00:34:38,800 --> 00:34:40,700
That is my little secret.

688
00:34:41,240 --> 00:34:43,020
How could I casually tell someone else?

689
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:40,820
-Good!
-Good!

690
00:35:47,240 --> 00:35:48,380
My lord.

691
00:35:49,320 --> 00:35:50,460
What is wrong?

692
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:52,380
Why do you look so pale?

693
00:35:53,240 --> 00:35:54,380
My lord.

694
00:35:59,160 --> 00:36:01,020
My lord, what are you looking for?

695
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:03,940
A ghost.

696
00:36:17,160 --> 00:36:18,900
Sister A-Xiang.

697
00:36:22,680 --> 00:36:24,056
Let go! Let go of me!

698
00:36:24,080 --> 00:36:26,536
Sister A-Xiang!

699
00:36:26,560 --> 00:36:30,140
Let go of me!

700
00:36:30,560 --> 00:36:32,300
Let go of me...

701
00:36:32,720 --> 00:36:34,140
Let go!

702
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:36,820
Let go of me!

703
00:36:37,160 --> 00:36:39,740
Sister A-Xiang!

704
00:36:42,040 --> 00:36:43,736
Sister A-Xiang!

705
00:36:43,760 --> 00:36:48,456
Sister A-Xiang...

706
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:49,736
Enough!

707
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:51,460
Let go of me!

708
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:55,780
Release her.

709
00:36:56,120 --> 00:36:58,176
Run! Do not come back!

710
00:36:58,200 --> 00:37:00,140
Sister A-Xiang!

711
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:18,140
It is the middle of the night.

712
00:37:18,600 --> 00:37:19,776
Why are you knocking?

713
00:37:19,800 --> 00:37:20,936
My lord,

714
00:37:20,960 --> 00:37:22,980
you seemed distraught after returning,

715
00:37:23,480 --> 00:37:25,060
so I have been waiting outside your room.

716
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:26,576
Just now,

717
00:37:26,600 --> 00:37:28,336
I heard shouting from inside,

718
00:37:28,360 --> 00:37:29,500
so I...

719
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:36,300
Help me investigate someone.

720
00:37:57,040 --> 00:37:58,256
Your Majesty,

721
00:37:58,280 --> 00:37:59,416
I have watched Huiyin House
for several months

722
00:37:59,440 --> 00:38:00,776
and found nothing unusual.

723
00:38:00,800 --> 00:38:02,176
Only occasionally,
at the beginning of each month,

724
00:38:02,200 --> 00:38:03,296
the musicians take a convoy to the border

725
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,940
to purchase daily supplies.

726
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:07,176
Do you truly suspect

727
00:38:07,200 --> 00:38:08,576
that those highly trained assassins

728
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:09,616
belong to Huiyin House?

729
00:38:09,640 --> 00:38:11,580
Whether my intuition is right

730
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:13,380
will be revealed by a simple test.

731
00:38:25,200 --> 00:38:27,536
-Keep everything steady.
-Certainly.

732
00:38:27,560 --> 00:38:29,456
Most of these musicians come
from the common streets.

733
00:38:29,480 --> 00:38:30,416
It is hardly strange

734
00:38:30,440 --> 00:38:31,940
for them to know some martial arts.

735
00:38:33,720 --> 00:38:34,980
What is strange

736
00:38:35,360 --> 00:38:37,740
is that too many coincidences
have come together.

737
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:42,140
My lord.

738
00:38:42,440 --> 00:38:44,100
We found it.

739
00:38:54,200 --> 00:38:55,336
My lord,

740
00:38:55,360 --> 00:38:56,900
do you know this person?

741
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:44,256
Our previous assassination failed

742
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:46,576
because we underestimated
that wretched emperor.

743
00:39:46,600 --> 00:39:48,736
Shen Zhishu and Huang Bo
protect him openly,

744
00:39:48,760 --> 00:39:50,540
and he has secretly
trained elite shadow guards.

745
00:39:50,840 --> 00:39:52,256
Master Shangguan has given the order.

746
00:39:52,280 --> 00:39:53,576
We have already alerted the enemy,

747
00:39:53,600 --> 00:39:55,096
so the assassination is suspended for now.

748
00:39:55,120 --> 00:39:56,620
But our great cause must not be abandoned.

749
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:58,220
Understood.

750
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,456
In this operation,

751
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:01,180
we will proceed with the utmost caution.

752
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:11,220
Young Master He, Young Master Shen.

753
00:40:13,640 --> 00:40:14,896
Miss Situ, only three days have passed,

754
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:16,216
yet you look even more radiant.

755
00:40:16,240 --> 00:40:17,976
Today's makeup is like peach blossoms
reflected in spring water,

756
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:19,776
brilliant without being gaudy,
pure and refined.

757
00:40:19,800 --> 00:40:21,056
Every time Young Master Shen sees me,

758
00:40:21,080 --> 00:40:22,456
his lavish compliments never stop

759
00:40:22,480 --> 00:40:23,736
and are never repeated.

760
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,776
-How very thoughtful of you.
-I saw several musicians

761
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:27,896
with carriages prepared
and in a great hurry.

762
00:40:27,920 --> 00:40:29,500
Is there some urgent matter?

763
00:40:29,960 --> 00:40:31,576
They are merely going
to the border to purchase

764
00:40:31,600 --> 00:40:33,856
incense, fabrics, and other
supplies for the house.

765
00:40:33,880 --> 00:40:35,376
It seems none of the capital's shops

766
00:40:35,400 --> 00:40:37,540
can satisfy the proprietress.

767
00:40:37,760 --> 00:40:38,976
You must mobilize such a large group

768
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:40,216
just to shop at the border.

769
00:40:40,240 --> 00:40:41,736
To tell you the truth,

770
00:40:41,760 --> 00:40:43,856
Huiyin House consumes great quantities

771
00:40:43,880 --> 00:40:44,896
of incense and wood for instruments.

772
00:40:44,920 --> 00:40:46,376
The expense is considerable.

773
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:48,336
Since Great Ning opened trade with Beijian,

774
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:50,616
goods at the border have been excellent
and fairly priced.

775
00:40:50,640 --> 00:40:51,856
I often send the musicians

776
00:40:51,880 --> 00:40:54,256
to purchase unusual items there

777
00:40:54,280 --> 00:40:55,416
to attract customers.

778
00:40:55,440 --> 00:40:57,780
You truly know how to run a business.

779
00:40:58,400 --> 00:40:59,816
No wonder Huiyin House

780
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:01,856
has become the capital's
foremost establishment,

781
00:41:01,880 --> 00:41:04,300
frequented by
powerful officials and nobles.

782
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:06,776
Gentlemen, please do not remain standing.

783
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:08,540
Tea has been prepared in a private room.

784
00:41:09,240 --> 00:41:10,336
I will take you there.

785
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:12,136
There is no hurry.

786
00:41:12,160 --> 00:41:13,896
I have not yet had the chance

787
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:15,540
to properly look around the first floor.

788
00:41:17,520 --> 00:41:18,976
You little wretch.

789
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:20,820
Were you so eager to see me?
